{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T06:45:49+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-22T06:45:49+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Eni S.p.A.","sector":"Energy","industry":"Oil & Gas Integrated","country":"Italy","city":"Rome","website":"https://www.eni.com","employees":32168,"summary":"Eni S.p.A. operates as an integrated energy company in Italy, Other European Union, Rest of Europe, the United States, Asia, Africa, and internationally. The company engages in exploration, development, extracting, manufacturing, trading, and marketing crude oil and natural gas, oil-based fuels, chemical products, and gas-fired power, as well as energy products from renewable sources. The company operates through Exploration & Production; Global Gas & LNG Portfolio and Power; Refining and Chemicals; Enilive; Plenitude; and Corporate and Other Activities segments. The company engages in research, development, and production of oil, condensates, and natural gas. It is also involved in the supply and sale of wholesale natural gas through pipelines; electricity; and international transport, and purchase and marketing of liquefied natural gas. In addition, the company supplies bio-feedstock and crude oil; and stores, produces, distributes, and markets biofuels, oil products, biomethane, basic chemical and petrochemical products, intermediates, plastics and elastomers, and other chemicals, as well as provides smart mobility solutions and services. Further, the company engages in the retail marketing of gas, power, and related services; production and wholesale sale of electricity from renewable plants; and building and managing a network of charging points for electric vehicles. Eni S.p.A. was founded in 1953 and is headquartered in Rome, Italy.","exchange":"Milan","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"Eni S.p.A. opère en tant que société énergétique intégrée en Italie, dans d’autres pays de l’Union européenne, dans le reste de l’Europe, aux États-Unis, en Asie, en Afrique et à l’international. La société se livre à l'exploration, au développement, à l'extraction, à la fabrication, au commerce et à la commercialisation de pétrole brut et de gaz naturel, de combustibles à base de pétrole, de produits chimiques et d'énergie au gaz, ainsi que de produits énergétiques issus de sources renouvelables. La société exerce ses activités par l'entremise des secteurs Exploration et production; Portefeuille et électricité mondiaux de gaz et GNL; Raffinage et produits chimiques; Enilive; Plénitude; et Activités corporatives et autres."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":75606351872,"shares_outstanding":2863876858,"trailing_pe":21.81818,"forward_pe":9.91177,"price_to_book":1.6725798,"ev_to_ebitda":7.84,"ev_to_revenue":1.154,"dividend_yield":0.0416,"payout_ratio":0.85370004,"beta_yahoo":0.264},"targets":{"current_price":26.4,"mean":26.48636,"median":26.0,"high":32.0,"low":19.0,"n_analysts":22,"reco_mean":2.22727,"reco_key":"buy"},"calendar":{"earnings_dates":["2026-10-23"],"eps_avg":0.83082,"eps_low":0.78,"eps_high":0.88,"revenue_avg":34072702700,"ex_dividend":"2026-11-23","dividend_date":null},"holders":{"insiders_pct":0.36356997,"institutions_pct":0.25999,"institutions_float_pct":0.40852,"institutions_n":529,"institutions":[{"name":"Pacer Advisors, Inc.","pct":0.0008,"shares":2408860,"value":63593903,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":-0.0271},{"name":"Paradigm Asset Management Company, LLC","pct":0.0,"shares":3900,"value":102959,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.0419},{"name":"Generali Investments Cee, Investicni Spolecnost, A.s.","pct":0.0,"shares":124300,"value":3281519,"date":"2026-09-30","chg":0.0}],"funds":[{"name":"VANGUARD STAR FUNDS-Vanguard Total International Stock Index Fund","pct":0.009,"shares":27150569,"value":716775011,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":-0.0135},{"name":"Goldman Sachs TRT II-Goldman Sachs GQG Part. Intl Opportunities Fd.","pct":0.0070999996,"